llm-blocks

This project contains code derived from or closely following:

* state-spaces/mamba (Apache-2.0), Tri Dao & Albert Gu — the chunked SSD algorithm in
  llm_blocks/kernels/ssd.py follows mamba_ssm/modules/ssd_minimal.py; the Mamba-2 layer layout
  and initialisation follow mamba_ssm/modules/mamba2.py.
* fla-org/flash-linear-attention (MIT) — layer layout of the Gated DeltaNet mixer
  (llm_blocks/nn/mixers/gated_deltanet.py).
* ALiBi slope computation follows the reference implementation of Press et al. (ofirpress/attention_with_linear_biases, MIT).

Reference tests compare against HuggingFace transformers (Apache-2.0) implementations of Llama,
DeepSeek-V3 attention, Mamba-2 and the Qwen3-Next gated delta rule; transformers is an optional
test dependency and none of its code is vendored.
